{"translation-revision-date":"2025-02-05 09:24-0500","generator":"WP-CLI\/2.11.0","source":"dist\/js\/interface.RETIRE-SAVINGS.gpl.js","domain":"messages","locale_data":{"messages":{"":{"domain":"messages","lang":"en","plural-forms":"nplurals=2; plural=(n != 1);"},"en":["da"],"Please use the backspace key to delete.":["Brug venligst backspace-tasten til at slette."],"Left, up & down arrow keys are disabled. So are the home, end, pgup and pgdn keys.":["Piletasterne til venstre, op og ned er deaktiveret. Det samme g\u00e6lder tasterne home, end, pgup og pgdn."],"Use backspace to delete.":["Brug backspace for at slette."],"If value is selected, just start typing new value to clear prior value.":["Hvis v\u00e6rdien er valgt, skal du blot begynde at skrive en ny v\u00e6rdi for at slette den tidligere v\u00e6rdi."],"When a number is selected (value shown in inverse), use right arrow key to clear selection without clearing value. Then backspace to edit.":["N\u00e5r et tal er valgt (v\u00e6rdien vises omvendt), kan du bruge h\u00f8jre piletast til at slette valget uden at slette v\u00e6rdien. Brug derefter backspace for at redigere."],"TIP: Generally it is best to use the TAB or SHIFT-TAB keys to move from one input to the next or previous input.":["TIP: Generelt er det bedst at bruge TAB- eller SHIFT-TAB-tasterne til at g\u00e5 fra en indtastning til den n\u00e6ste eller forrige indtastning."],"TIP 2: Generally, editing a value is inefficient. Since values are auto selected, just type the number you want.":["TIP 2: Generelt er det ineffektivt at redigere en v\u00e6rdi. Da v\u00e6rdier er automatisk valgte, skal du blot skrive det \u00f8nskede tal."],"Do not type the thousand separator character.":["Du m\u00e5 ikke skrive tusindseparatoren."],"(If using U.S. convention, that would be the comma.)":["(Hvis der anvendes amerikansk konvention, ville det v\u00e6re kommaet.)"],"I'm smart enough to enter them for you!":["Jeg er smart nok til at indtaste dem for dig!"],"An unknown date calculation error occurred.":["Der er opst\u00e5et en ukendt fejl i beregningen af en dato."],"Please provide us with your inputs and settings so that we can fix this. Thank you.":["Giv os venligst dine input og indstillinger, s\u00e5 vi kan l\u00f8se dette problem. Tak."],"Date is not valid - bad year.":["Datoen er ikke gyldig - d\u00e5rligt \u00e5rstal."],"Jan":["Jan"],"Feb":["Feb"],"Mar":["Mar"],"Apr":["Apr"],"May":["Maj"],"Jun":["Jun"],"Jul":["Jul"],"Aug":["Aug"],"Sept":["Sep"],"Oct":["Okt"],"Nov":["Nov"],"Dec":["dec."],"Error: dates out of sequence.":["Fejl: datoer i forkert r\u00e6kkef\u00f8lge."],"Exception":["Undtagelse"],"occurred when accessing":["opstod ved adgang til"],"Invalid index":["Ugyldigt indeks"],"YTD":["\u00c5TD"],"Running Totals":["L\u00f8bende totaler"],"Your Personalized Retirement Schedule":["Din personlige pensionsplan"],"Retirement Plan Summary":["Resum\u00e9 af pensionsplanen"],"Total Investment":["Samlet investering"],"Number of Investments":["Antal investeringer"],"Return on Investment (ROI)":["Investeringens afkast (ROI)"],"Total Gain":["Samlet gevinst"],"Gain on Investment":["Gevinst p\u00e5 investering"],"Last Cash Flow Date":["Sidste pengestr\u00f8msdato"],"Years":["\u00c5r"],"Investment Schedule":["Investeringsplan"],"Year":["\u00c5r"],"Date":["Dato"],"Investment":["Investering"],"Investment Gain":["Investeringsgevinst"],"Net Change":["Netto\u00e6ndring"],"Balance":["Saldo"],"Annual Investment":["\u00c5rlig investering"],"Annual Interest":["\u00c5rlig rente"],"Annual Investment Gain":["\u00c5rlig investeringsgevinst"],"Change in Balance":["\u00c6ndring i saldoen"],"Annual Investment and Interest Totals":["\u00c5rlige investeringer og renter i alt"],"Accumulated Investment and Interest":["Akkumulerede investeringer og renter"],"Amount Invested & Interest as Percentage of Total Value":["Investeret bel\u00f8b og rente som procentdel af den samlede v\u00e6rdi"],"\"Net Change\" is change from prior period i.e. prior balance plus investment, plus gain on investment (interest).":["\"Netto\u00e6ndring\" er \u00e6ndringen fra den foreg\u00e5ende periode, dvs. tidligere saldo plus investering plus gevinst p\u00e5 investering (renter)."],"Running Investment":["L\u00f8bende investering"],"Running Interest":["L\u00f8bende rente"],"Running Investment Gain":["L\u00f8bende investeringsgevinst"],"Total Deposits":["Indl\u00e5n i alt"],"Total Interest Earned":["Samlede renteindt\u00e6gter"],"Total Value":["Samlet v\u00e6rdi"],"Pct. of Total":["Pct. af totalen"],"Your Personalized Cash Flow Schedule":["Din personlige pengestr\u00f8msplan"],"Current age must be greater than 0.":["Den aktuelle alder skal v\u00e6re st\u00f8rre end 0."],"\"Retirement Age\" must be greater than \"Current Age\"":["\"Pensionsalder\" skal v\u00e6re st\u00f8rre end \"Nuv\u00e6rende alder\""],"Retirement Savings Calculator \u2014 calculate savings required to reach retirement goal":["Pensionsopsparingsberegner - beregn den opsparing, der er n\u00f8dvendig for at n\u00e5 pensioneringsm\u00e5let"],"<p>This calculator easily answers the question \"Given the value of my current investments how much do I need to save each month to reach my retirement goal?\"<\/p>":["<p>Denne beregner besvarer nemt sp\u00f8rgsm\u00e5let \"Med v\u00e6rdien af mine nuv\u00e6rende investeringer, hvor meget skal jeg spare op hver m\u00e5ned for at n\u00e5 mit pensionsm\u00e5l?\"<\/p>"],"<p>The user enters their \"Current Age\", their expected \"Retirement Age\", the \"Annual Interest Rate (ROR)\" (annualized Rate-of-Return one expects to earn) and \"Amount At Retirement\" (the goal amount).<\/p>":["<p>Brugeren indtaster deres \"Nuv\u00e6rende alder\", den forventede \"Pensionsalder\", \"\u00c5rlige rentesats (ROR)\" (\u00e5rlig afkastforventning) og \"Bel\u00f8b ved pensionering\" (m\u00e5let).<\/p>"],"<p class=\"tail\">The calculator quickly calculates the required monthly investment amount and creates an investment schedule plus a set of charts that will help the user see the relationship between the amount invested and the return on the investment.<\/p>":["<p class=\"tail\">Beregneren beregner hurtigt det n\u00f8dvendige m\u00e5nedlige investeringsbel\u00f8b og opretter en investeringsplan samt en r\u00e6kke diagrammer, der hj\u00e6lper brugeren med at se forholdet mellem det investerede bel\u00f8b og afkastet p\u00e5 investeringen.<\/p>"],"<p class=\"small\" style=\"font-size: 85%; line-height: 1.5; color:red; user-select: text\">If you need a more advanced \"Retirement Calculator\" - one that calculates many more unknowns and one that calculates assuming retirement <b>income<\/b> and not a final lump sum then try the calculator located here: <b>https:\/\/AccurateCalculators.com\/retirement-calculator<\/b><\/p>":["<p class=\"small\" style=\"font-size: 85%; line-height: 1.5; color:red; user-select: text\">Hvis du har brug for en mere avanceret \"Pensionsberegner\" - en der beregner mange flere ukendte og antager pensions<b>indkomst<\/b> i stedet for en slutbetaling, s\u00e5 pr\u00f8v beregneren her: <b>https:\/\/AccurateCalculators.com\/retirement-calculator<\/b><\/p>"],"<p class=\"small\" style=\"font-size: 85%; line-height: 1.5; color:red; user-select: text\">Need more options including the ability to solve for other unknowns? Ability to create, in one schedule, the pre-retirement and post-retirement cashflow? Print the chart? Export to MS Word&trade; (.docx) or MS Excel&trade; (.xlsx) files? Please visit, <b>https:\/\/AccurateCalculators.com\/retirement-calculator<\/b><\/p>":["<p class=\"small\" style=\"font-size: 85%; line-height: 1.5; color:red; user-select: text\">Brug for flere muligheder, herunder evnen til at l\u00f8se andre ukendte? Mulighed for at oprette, i \u00e9n plan, pr\u00e6- og post-pensionspengestr\u00f8m? Udskrive diagrammet? Eksportere til MS Word&trade; (.docx) eller MS Excel&trade; (.xlsx) filer? Bes\u00f8g venligst, <b>https:\/\/AccurateCalculators.com\/retirement-calculator<\/b><\/p>"],"Prepared for":["Forberedt til"],"Address":["Adresse"],"City, State  ZIP":["By, Region, Postnummer"],"Prepared On":["Forberedt den"],"Prepared by":["Forberederens navn"],"Phone":["Telefon"],"Email":["E-mail"],"Website":["Hjemmeside"],"Unknown":["Ukendt"],"u":["u"],"U":["U"],"Dates must be the first of the month.":["Datoer skal v\u00e6re den f\u00f8rste i m\u00e5neden."],"An invalid JavaScript date object.":["Et ugyldigt JavaScript-datoobjekt."],"Monthly":["M\u00e5nedlig"]}}}